{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳多張照片，指一輛 Tesla 私家車，懷疑私自使用九龍灣某商場的公眾 13A 插蘇充電，事件曝光後迅速在各大社交平台引起熱議。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"780651198_10162866415071604_6228353952369459393_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20266C8KAoB9e71787293557.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"780651198_10162866415071604_6228353952369459393_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從網上圖片可見，事發地位於九龍灣某商場的停車場7樓。涉事車輛為一輛貼上啞灰色車身膜、加裝了尾翼及大包圍的 Tesla 私家車，泊於車位內的車主將隨車充電線直接接駁至旁邊藍色牆身柱上的 13A 公眾插蘇座。上載照片的網民留言直斥：「咁明目張膽用商場啲電叉電 (已同商場職員講，佢地影左相話跟進)」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"780912939_10162866415551604_6982362513374131540_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026GpvCmayMWc1787293575.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"780912939_10162866415551604_6982362513374131540_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">貼文引起熱議，大批留言紛紛指責車主行為極度自私，甚至質疑已涉嫌違法：「可以報警。偷電算係盜竊。」除了批評聲浪外，網民亦紛紛對車主的行為嘲諷差：「有錢貼膜、加尾翼、裝大包圍，居然肉酸到要偷電差，連13A都唔放過，正宗鱷魚頭老襯底～」、「有錢裝包圍冇錢叉電」。同時，更有熟悉電動車規格的網民留言精算，指出用 13A 插蘇充電效率極低：「13 A慢叉，一個鐘頭叉得嗰兩度電，呢個車超過70度，起碼差35個鐘」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"778664593_10162866415291604_8327123337291448825_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026XArBMlNynE1787293592.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"778664593_10162866415291604_8327123337291448825_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T06:39:55.948830+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":419,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}